OL,3,GNEWSAPlaque unveiled for Belgian World
OL,4,AWar One workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plaque commemorating Belgian World
OL,7,FWar One soldiers and civilians who
OL,8,Fworked in a British ammunition factory
OL,9,Fhas been unveiled.
OL,11,FLess than a year into the war, Britain
OL,12,Fwas running out of artillery shells so
OL,13,Fwounded Belgian soldiers who had been
OL,14,Fbrought over to recover staffed the
OL,15,Fnewly opened factory in 1916 in
OL,16,FBirtley, in Gateshead.
OL,18,FAlongside refugees who had fled their
OL,19,Fhome country, the Belgian community in
OL,20,FBirtley was 6,000 strong, with most
OL,21,Fcontributing to the war effort.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
